an></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">v </span><span class=\"fn\">x </span><span class=\"fn\">y </span><span class=\"fn\">z </span><span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`v + x + (c - 2) - y - z` as its low word and its high word plus `2`, for a carry `c` between\n`0` and `3` that is the true carry plus `2`.","docLink":"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.addDiffStep","kind":"def","line":413,"name":"UInt32.addDiffStep","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Arch/UInt.lean#L413-L419"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.toNat_div2Rem\"><span class=\"name\">UInt32</span>.<span class=\"name\">toNat_div2Rem</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hi </span><span class=\"fn\">lo </span><span class=\"fn\">d</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">h</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">hi</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">d</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">hi</span>.<a href=\"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.div2Rem\">div2Rem</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">lo</span> <span class=\"fn\">d</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.fst\">fst</a></span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> (<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">hi</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">32</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">lo</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span>) <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HDiv.hDiv\">/</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">d</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#And\">∧</a>   <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">hi</span>.<a href=\"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.div2Rem\">div2Rem</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">lo</span> <span class=\"fn\">d</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.snd\">snd</a></span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> (<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">hi</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">32</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">lo</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span>) <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMod.hMod\">%</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">d</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.toNat_div2Rem","kind":"theorem","line":395,"name":"UInt32.toNat_div2Rem","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Arch/UInt.lean#L395-L409"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.div2Rem\"><span class=\"name\">UInt32</span>.<span class=\"name\">div2Rem</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hi </span><span class=\"fn\">lo </span><span class=\"fn\">d</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The quotient and remainder of `hi β + lo` by `d`, where `β = 2³²`, from one division of the\n`UInt64` `hi β + lo`, which the C compiler makes one instruction.","docLink":"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.div2Rem","kind":"def","line":386,"name":"UInt32.div2Rem","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Arch/UInt.lean#L386-L393"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.subMulBiased_not\"><span class=\"name\">UInt32</span>.<span class=\"name\">subMulBiased_not</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">y </span><span class=\"fn\">x </span><span class=\"fn\">v </span><span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">y</span>.<a href=\"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.subMulBiased\">subMulBiased</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">x</span> <span class=\"fn\">v</span> (<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Complement.complement\">~~~</a><span class=\"fn\">c</span>)</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">(</a><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">y</span>.<a href=\"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.subMul\">subMul</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">x</span> <span class=\"fn\">v</span> <span class=\"fn\">c</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.fst\">fst</a></span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">,</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Complement.complement\">~~~</a><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">y</span>.<a href=\"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.subMul\">subMul</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">x</span> <span class=\"fn\">v</span> <span class=\"fn\">c</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.snd\">snd</a></span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">)</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.subMulBiased_not","kind":"theorem","line":355,"name":"UInt32.subMulBiased_not","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Arch/UInt.lean#L355-L376"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.subMulBiased\"><span class=\"name\">UInt32</span>.<span class=\"name\">subMulBiased</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">y </span><span class=\"fn\">x </span><span class=\"fn\">v </span><span class=\"fn\">h</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`subMul` with the borrow `c` carried as `h = 2³² - 1 - c`, which shortens the dependency chain\nfrom one limb to the next. The value `y - x v - c` lies in `[2³² - 2⁶⁴, 2³²)`, so adding\n`2⁶⁴ - 2³²` makes it a word, whose low half is the limb and whose high half is `2³² - 1` minus the\nnext borrow: the step is `y - x v - (2³³ - 1) + h`, without the negation of the borrow.","docLink":"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.subMulBiased","kind":"def","line":339,"name":"UInt32.subMulBiased","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Arch/UInt.lean#L339-L347"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.subMul_spec\"><span class=\"name\">UInt32</span>.<span class=\"name\">subMul_spec</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">y </span><span class=\"fn\">x </span><span class=\"fn\">v </span><span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">y</span>.<a href=\"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.subMul\">subMul</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">x</span> <span class=\"fn\">v</span> <span class=\"fn\">c</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.fst\">fst</a></span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">x</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">v</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">c</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">y</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">y</span>.<a href=\"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.subMul\">subMul</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">x</span> <span class=\"fn\">v</span> <span class=\"fn\">c</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.snd\">snd</a></span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">32</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.subMul_spec","kind":"theorem","line":325,"name":"UInt32.subMul_spec","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Arch/UInt.lean#L325-L337"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.subMul\"><span class=\"name\">UInt32</span>.<span class=\"name\">subMul</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">y </span><span class=\"fn\">x </span><span class=\"fn\">v </span><span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`y - (x * v + c)` as its low word, wrapping, and the borrow word `b`, so that\n`lo + x * v + c = y + b * 2³²`; the step of `subMul1`. The borrow fits in a word since\n`x * v + c < 2⁶⁴`. It computes `y - (x * v + c)` modulo `2⁶⁴`, whose high word is `-b`.","docLink":"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.subMul","kind":"def","line":316,"name":"UInt32.subMul","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Arch/UInt.lean#L316-L323"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.subWithBorrow_zero_true\"><span class=\"name\">UInt32</span>.<span class=\"name\">subWithBorrow_zero_true</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">x</span>.<a href=\"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.subWithBorrow\">subWithBorrow</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">0</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool.true\">true</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">(</a><span class=\"fn\">x</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HSub.hSub\">-</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">,</a> <span class=\"fn\">x</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BEq.beq\">==</a> <span class=\"fn\">0</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">)</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Subtracting a borrow alone: `x - 1`, with a borrow out exactly when `x` is zero.","docLink":"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.subWithBorrow_zero_true","kind":"theorem","line":303,"name":"UInt32.subWithBorrow_zero_true","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Arch/UInt.lean#L303-L314"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.addWithCarry_zero_true\"><span class=\"name\">UInt32</span>.<span class=\"name\">addWithCarry_zero_true</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">x</span>.<a href=\"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.addWithCarry\">addWithCarry</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">0</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool.true\">true</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">(</a><span class=\"fn\">x</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">,</a> <span class=\"fn\">x</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BEq.beq\">==</a> <span class=\"fn\">4294967295</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">)</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Adding a carry alone: `x + 1`, with a carry out exactly when `x` is the largest word.","docLink":"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.addWithCarry_zero_true","kind":"theorem","line":290,"name":"UInt32.addWithCarry_zero_true","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Arch/UInt.lean#L290-L301"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.dblAddAdd_spec\"><span class=\"name\">UInt32</span>.<span class=\"name\">dblAddAdd_spec</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x </span><span class=\"fn\">d </span><span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">x</span>.<a href=\"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.dblAddAdd\">dblAddAdd</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">d</span> <span class=\"fn\">c</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.fst\">fst</a></span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">