s low word and its high word, the step of `mpn_sqr_diag_addlsh1`-style\nsquaring: twice a limb of the cross products plus a limb of the diagonal and the carry, which is\nat most `2`.","docLink":"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.dblAddAdd","kind":"def","line":264,"name":"UInt32.dblAddAdd","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Arch/UInt.lean#L264-L271"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.subWithCarryWord_toUInt32\"><span class=\"name\">UInt32</span>.<span class=\"name\">subWithCarryWord_toUInt32</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x </span><span class=\"fn\">y</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">x</span>.<a href=\"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.subWithCarryWord\">subWithCarryWord</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">y</span> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool.not\">!</a><span class=\"fn\">b</span>).<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/Basic.html#Bool.toUInt32\">toUInt32</a></span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">(</a><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">x</span>.<a href=\"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.subWithBorrow\">subWithBorrow</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">y</span> <span class=\"fn\">b</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.fst\">fst</a></span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">,</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool.not\">!</a><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">x</span>.<a href=\"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.subWithBorrow\">subWithBorrow</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">y</span> <span class=\"fn\">b</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.snd\">snd</a></span>).<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/Basic.html#Bool.toUInt32\">toUInt32</a></span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">)</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.subWithCarryWord_toUInt32","kind":"theorem","line":243,"name":"UInt32.subWithCarryWord_toUInt32","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Arch/UInt.lean#L243-L262"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.addWithCarryWord_toUInt32\"><span class=\"name\">UInt32</span>.<span class=\"name\">addWithCarryWord_toUInt32</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x </span><span class=\"fn\">y</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">x</span>.<a href=\"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.addWithCarryWord\">addWithCarryWord</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">y</span> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">c</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/Basic.html#Bool.toUInt32\">toUInt32</a></span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">(</a><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">x</span>.<a href=\"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.addWithCarry\">addWithCarry</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">y</span> <span class=\"fn\">c</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.fst\">fst</a></span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">,</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">x</span>.<a href=\"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.addWithCarry\">addWithCarry</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">y</span> <span class=\"fn\">c</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.snd\">snd</a></span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/Basic.html#Bool.toUInt32\">toUInt32</a></span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">)</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.addWithCarryWord_toUInt32","kind":"theorem","line":229,"name":"UInt32.addWithCarryWord_toUInt32","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Arch/UInt.lean#L229-L241"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.subWithCarryWord\"><span class=\"name\">UInt32</span>.<span class=\"name\">subWithCarryWord</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x </span><span class=\"fn\">y </span><span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`x - y` with a carry word `c = 1 - b`, `0` or `1`, in place of the borrow `b`: `x + ~y + c`, which\nis `x - y - b + 2 ^ 32`, by `addWithCarryWord`, whose carry out is `1` exactly when there is no\nborrow out. A borrow taken from `x - y` last, as the sign of `x - y - b`, compiles to a compare and\na flag read on AArch64, which makes a longer dependency chain than the add and shift of\n`addWithCarryWord`.","docLink":"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.subWithCarryWord","kind":"def","line":219,"name":"UInt32.subWithCarryWord","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Arch/UInt.lean#L219-L227"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.addWithCarryWord\"><span class=\"name\">UInt32</span>.<span class=\"name\">addWithCarryWord</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x </span><span class=\"fn\">y </span><span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`addWithCarry` with the carry as a word, `0` or `1`. The compiled loops thread this carry, which\ncompiles to a shorter dependency chain than a `Bool`. As in `mulAddAdd`, the carry joins `x + y`\nlast, and that sum is also used for the low word, so that LLVM does not add the carry first.","docLink":"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.addWithCarryWord","kind":"def","line":210,"name":"UInt32.addWithCarryWord","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Arch/UInt.lean#L210-L217"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.mulAddAdd_spec\"><span class=\"name\">UInt32</span>.<span class=\"name\">mulAddAdd_spec</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x </span><span class=\"fn\">y </span><span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">x</span>.<a href=\"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.mulAddAdd\">mulAddAdd</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">y</span> <span class=\"fn\">a</span> <span class=\"fn\">b</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.fst\">fst</a></span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">x</span>.<a href=\"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.mulAddAdd\">mulAddAdd</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">y</span> <span class=\"fn\">a</span> <span class=\"fn\">b</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.snd\">snd</a></span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">32</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">x</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">y</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">b</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.mulAddAdd_spec","kind":"theorem","line":196,"name":"UInt32.mulAddAdd_spec","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Arch/UInt.lean#L196-L208"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Arch/UInt.html#UInt32.subWithBorrow_spec\"><span class=\"name\">UInt32</span>.<span